"}, {"title": "claude code release notes", "url": "https://claudelog.com/faqs/claude-code-release-notes"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.231"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.232"}, {"title": "• Tech Dev NotesTech Dev Notes", "url": "https://techdevnotes.com/releases/claude-code/2.1.168"}, {"title": "Remote OpenClaw Blog", "url": "https://www.remoteopenclaw.com/blog/claude-code-changelog"}, {"title": "Claude Code v1.0.1 → v2.1.310: what changed", "url": "https://www.havoptic.com/r/claude-code/diff?from=1.0.1&to=latest"}], "tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01Gf357GvorA1sFuvYPEFCVn"}, "The most recent version I found is **v2.1.310**, dated October 23, 2026, though sources disagree and the newest listing is about three weeks old.\n\n- **Highest version found:** A Havoptic comparison page lists v2.1.310 as released October 23, 2026 (390 releases shipped between v1.0.1 (May 22, 2025) and v2.1.310 (October 23, 2026).)\n- **Older snapshots:** A releases.sh mirror of the official changelog shows v2.1.294 dated October 8, 2026 and lists 359 total releases (latest_version: v2.1.294). Other sites show older builds, such as v2.1.215 (July 19, 2026) and v2.1.207 (July 10, 2026).\n- **Official source:** The changelog lives at code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog and is mirrored in the anthropics/claude-code GitHub repository's CHANGELOG.md.\n- **Checking your install:** Run `claude --version` to see your build and `claude update` to upgrade. Some summaries say Claude Code also self-updates on launch by default.\n\nI could not confirm v2.1.310 against the official changelog page, so verify there before relying on it."], "searchCount": 1}, "type": "user", "uuid": "adb626c7-87ac-4fa4-9007-3944eec19f08"}
